The `{{ namespace }}.{{ collection_name }}` Ansible collection manages the configuration of an installed {{ product | mandatory('Missing required variable: product') }} through its command line. The modules run on the host where the product is installed, call its command and bring one object into the state you declare.
{% endfilter %}{{ '' }}

The collection does not install the product and does not create its
credential. The modules change objects that exist; they do not create or
delete them.

